# Daily News — optional API keys
#
# By default the app uses the free Hacker News API (no key required).
# To switch to general world news, provide ONE of the keys below and restart
# the dev server. GNews is recommended for browser apps (CORS-friendly).
#
# GNews — https://gnews.io/  (free tier)
# VITE_GNEWS_API_KEY=your_gnews_key_here
#
# NewsAPI.org — https://newsapi.org/  (free tier works on localhost only)
# VITE_NEWS_API_KEY=your_newsapi_key_here
# VITE_NEWS_API_COUNTRY=us   # 2-letter country for top-headlines (default: us)
